It's better to copy first frame and last frame values to extend vector sequence beyond boundaries than to assign 0. This could be implemented just by adjusting indexes:

if (index1 < 0)
 index1 = 0
if (index2 > N - 1)
 index2 = N - 1

delta = v[index1] - v[index2]

